{"id":"n61426-1-3","stage":5,"title":"동동 · 噔噔","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61426-1-3-1","ko":"너 어떻게 삼십 분이나 늦을 수가 있니?","zh":"你怎么会迟到三十分钟啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼십","meaning":"三十","explanation":"삼십：三十","readings":[{"term":"삼십","audio":"/audio/ad3bcec25d1da981651f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61994","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분이나","meaning":"分，分钟","explanation":"분：分，分钟；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70891","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦을","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"ad3bcec25d1da981","term":"삼십","zh":"三十","audio":"/audio/ad3bcec25d1da981651f.mp3","entryId":"61994","definition":"十的三倍的数目。","pronunciation":["삼십"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"分，分钟","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"70891","definition":"计时单位，表示一个小时的六十分之一。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/392a03a4b276b24d0b9e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61426-1-3-2","ko":"미안, 버스가 안 와서 나도 발만 동동 구르고 있었어.","zh":"对不起，因为公交车没来，我也在那儿急得团团转呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","explanation":"미안：抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","readings":[{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56257","senseId":"1","lemma":"미안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버스가","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来，开来","explanation":"오다：来，开来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"3","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발만","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동동","meaning":"噔噔","explanation":"동동：噔噔","readings":[{"term":"동동","audio":"/audio/fce7adea78bb1ea55288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61426","senseId":"1","lemma":"동동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구르고","meaning":"顿(足)，跺(脚)","explanation":"구르다：顿(足)，跺(脚)；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"구르다","audio":"/audio/140d9b165c63ec99bc01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34802","senseId":"1","lemma":"구르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ba804e5e1f459811","term":"미안","zh":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3","entryId":"56257","definition":"由于做了对不起别人的事而觉得心里不舒坦、感到羞愧。","pronunciation":["미안"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，开来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"交通工具朝着某个基准的地方运行。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발","zh":"足，脚","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3","entryId":"67886","definition":"人或动物腿部的最末端部分。","pronunciation":["발"]},{"id":"fce7adea78bb1ea5","term":"동동","zh":"噔噔","audio":"/audio/fce7adea78bb1ea55288.mp3","entryId":"61426","definition":"感到非常冷或很可惜，就不停地轻轻地跺脚的样子。","pronunciation":["동동"]},{"id":"140d9b165c63ec99","term":"구르다","zh":"顿(足)，跺(脚)","audio":"/audio/140d9b165c63ec99bc01.mp3","entryId":"34802","definition":"在站着的地方，用力把脚抬起又放下，踢得地板直响。","pronunciation":["구ː르다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce221f0e5da6d80ba8c1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.496,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61426","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，因为公交车没来，我也在那儿急得团团转呢。","你怎么会迟到三十分钟啊？","你现在手头一共有多少钱？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么会迟到三十分钟啊？","你现在手头一共有多少钱？","对不起，因为公交车没来，我也在那儿急得团团转呢。"],"answer":2}]}
